# Secrets

- Never commit API keys, keystore passwords, PEM/private keys, or Play Console
  service-account JSON.
- Per-slot secrets: `apps/<slot>/.env` (gitignored) + `.env.example` with placeholders.
- Keystore files (`*.jks`, `*.keystore`) stay outside git.
- `google-services.json` / `play-service-account.json` are gitignored; document
  how to obtain them in the slot README only as placeholders.
- Stripe/AWS/GitHub token patterns are blocked by `secret-guard` — honor the hook.
